        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Our hero Lolo has charmed and enchanted puzzle-loving game players around the world with his unfailing courage and plucky persistence - and now he's off for his second quest!\n\nJoin forces with Lolo and his faithful sidekick Lala for another journey full of puzzles and pitfalls. The whole crew is back - Snakey, Leeper, Medusa, Gol, Don Medusa, Rocky, and of course our favorite, Alma.\nImproved graphics, increased difficulty, and a few new tricks and techniques will keep you guessing through every fun-filled moment. A game for mental giants of all ages!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
